        "original_id": "a9e0e9a1-d92e-5f7a-bd3c-b883d3b0b111",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Michael Montgomery\n- Products: What I Do the Best\n- Topics: Singles, chart performance, Billboard country charts, Hot Country Songs\n\nFacts:\n- John Michael Montgomery is an American country music artist.\n- What I Do the Best is the fourth studio album by John Michael Montgomery.\n- Singles from What I Do the Best included \"Ain't Got Nothin' on Us,\" \"Friends,\" \"How Was I to Know,\" and \"I Miss You a Little.\"\n- On the Hot Country Songs charts, \"Ain't Got Nothin' on Us\" peaked at number 15, \"Friends\" peaked at number 2, \"How Was I to Know\" peaked at number 2, and \"I Miss You a Little\" peaked at number 6.\n- What I Do the Best was the first album in John Michael Montgomery's career not to produce a number 1 hit.\n- John Michael Montgomery has had more than 30 singles on the Billboard country charts.\n- Seven John Michael Montgomery singles reached number one on the Billboard country charts: \"I Love the Way You Love Me,\" \"I Swear,\" \"Be My Baby Tonight,\" \"If You've Got Love,\" \"I Can Love You Like That,\" \"Sold (The Grundy County Auction Incident),\" and \"The Little Girl\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "e07172e2-6b18-5b40-8358-5e37158eedec",
        "text": "Page: What I Do the Best. Sentence: What I Do the Best is the fourth studio album by American country music artist John Michael Montgomery.\nPage: What I Do the Best. Sentence: The tracks \"Ain't Got Nothin' on Us\", \"Friends\", \"How Was I to Know\" and \"I Miss You a Little\" were all released as singles, peaking at #15, #2, #2 and #6, respectively on the Hot Country Songs charts, making this the first album of his career not to produce a #1 hit.\nPage: John Michael Montgomery. Sentence: He has had more than 30 singles on the \"Billboard\" country charts, of which seven have reached number one: \"I Love the Way You Love Me\", \"I Swear\", \"Be My Baby Tonight\", \"If You've Got Love\", \"I Can Love You Like That\", \"Sold (The Grundy County Auction Incident)\", and \"The Little Girl\".",
